Package: cockpit-kea
Version: VERSION
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: cockpit-bridge
Recommends: kea-dhcp4-server | kea-dhcp6-server
Maintainer: MAINTAINER
Installed-Size: INSTALLED_SIZE
Homepage: https://github.com/sammiq/cockpit-kea
Description: Cockpit page for the ISC Kea DHCP server
 Shows the ISC Kea DHCP server in the Cockpit web console: the current
 DHCPv4 and DHCPv6 leases in one table (address, MAC address, hostname,
 description, lease start and end), read from Kea's memfile lease files,
 and the logs of the Kea services. Read-only.
